    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n          <span class=\"chip docker\">Docker</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Log Aggregation (ELK at scale)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Collect every log line from thousands of containers, keep it safe even when the storage is slow, and let an engineer search \"all errors for order 42 in the last hour\" in a couple of seconds - without spending more on logs than on the product.</p>\n      "
